{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JwsXjuOfrHksHOnkaBKNrA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:24.114346+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JwsXjuOfrHksHOnkaBKNrA","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/gVHPq8uAVssmPQyHTJmnMgiaWwHSEG1ibMEY7ySC7HiabmupbxNBrZMRYdNxibVTLt6GUxL0kOXGuzBbvVcJHR5QHDOv0n6Y2vnwzvJsicaJ5s04/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>关于接收2027推荐免试研究生预报名工作的通知</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/gVHPq8uAVss9E3tMZ7V5ictmPkSTmzwtYeiaiaBOfm59UE6P30F9skSItkwjGD0z7a8oBv3dHicPTr9zGtIcroicfe9iaufD7DUOyViczm5bXIIuUo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>欢迎全国各地获得推免资格的优秀学子申请加入江西财经大学软件与物联网工程学院！</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/gVHPq8uAVsuGgPnQH3NxNyrwtLtgicoZDicYp8yTlXlxJaRYE7wSthicstGaLKIibCWlN8qGbjgxTFYzNNR0PX9hDW1xFwY3zTEbSiajRyC23LFQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>学院概况</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1.学院介绍</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/gVHPq8uAVssrI56ic0yfrQLDjlmyHq5snzcU1CibPKJRxXzYsxnS901Qvx6IsJ4GicRLOCXnEVPB2FlmYdmLLibiathhWJLBRoDGfr3yDuksuff8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>江西财经大学软件与物联网工程学院（用友软件学院）成立于2002年，是江西省首批示范性软件学院、国家示范性软件学院联盟成员单位，入选首批校企合作示范性软件学院。学院坐落于麦庐园校区，是全国绿化300佳单位之一。</span></p><p><span>学院以“厚德明志，博学创新”为教学理念，致力于培养德、智、体、美、劳全面发展，具有“信敏廉毅”素质、“经济思维、管理素养和创新精神”的创新型工程技术人才。</span></p><p><span>学院拥有1个一级学科硕士学位授权点、2个专业硕士学位授权点，共建2个博士学位授权点。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2.培养理念</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/gVHPq8uAVsuzMzdM0cNFS6dlDdHNY5V5Kn3CYN1Az9Lp63pGic9fQjDUelRTTVT8QFiaZWiaNfv9HhuXvJuF3SRGDL0090pwO62LaZoFB0qE3g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>学院将“从0到1”的创新创业精神融入人才培养方案，开设创新创业必修课程，通过理论与实践相结合的教学方法引导学生深入理解真实项目开发流程，提升创新思维和软件开发技能。学院坚持开放办学，与瑞典达拉那大学、芬兰奥卢大学、英国埃塞克斯大学等多所国际知名高校合作。专任教师中超过三分之一有一年以上海外留学或进修经历。在研究生培养中，学院突出实践能力与科研素养并重，致力于培养具有国际视野和创新能力的高层次工程技术人才。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3.师资力量</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/gVHPq8uAVstbTnKJA8cFBic1jTgjSYWk65prA0eb6KNj60rF10m81xcnvkoePMk3RCwfpaYnwr1L8R3vNbeUK9ABb6QnPYE7tgjZv0Anh0Rw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>学院现有教职工100人，其中专职教师79人。教授12人、副教授25人，博士生导师4人、硕士生导师49人。专任教师中博士67人，博士占比84.8%（含海外大学博士毕业12人），有出国留学经历的教师占比43%。高层次人才包括：江西省新世纪“百千万”人才2位、江西省青年科学家（井冈之星）2位、江西省中青年学科带头人4位、江西省“中青年骨干教师”3位。学院师资队伍建设始终走在全省前列。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4.科研实力</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/gVHPq8uAVsupFwSxRflZiaOsewHwSNIo3cmXVQp6WS8HLpcicHkH7UMGOQ6ww8ccT34Y5tXOjzHibwurQH1iaicsjsnt9tGhRWdaibrjliasNpD2Y8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>江西近五年，学院教师立项国家自然科学基金项目14项、省级科研项目50余项。发表SCI、EI检索论文120余篇，出版专著20余部，获得专利授权30余项、软件著作权80余项。2025年，学院智能数据处理团队凭借“基于信息几何与稀疏表征的智能数据处理方法”项目，荣获江西省自然科学奖二等奖。该团队在IEEETransactions系列、《中国科学》《计算机学报》等高水平期刊发表论文70余篇，主持30余项省部级以上项目（含16项国家级），纵向科研经费共计900余万元。科研成果先后获得江西省自然科学奖、吴文俊人工智能自然科学奖等多项荣誉。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>5.学科特色</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/gVHPq8uAVsvBrULyMW9Zy5ViaurWswQdMDTjFgYFnANacDEm5hADt9iafMGLQGTrCiax5LWCibaD7yOWJOcMyaJpibqJaYUxAfIPnOUvUtkER810/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>学院拥有1个一级学科硕士学位授权点（软件工程，学术型）、2个专业硕士学位授权点（新一代电子信息技术、软件工程），共建2个博士学位授权点。学院聚焦软件工程、物联网、人工智能等前沿领域，研究方向涵盖智能与可信软件技术、智联网系统与计算技术、智能计算与现代优化技术、计算机视觉与智能图像分析、财经大数据处理等。软件工程专业为首批国家级一流本科专业建设点。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>6.科研平台与产学研合作</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/gVHPq8uAVstM2W9T5nqJrRhIwRiaOQLG2BibhsMOHPZXReq4cDaGd8VyKWEhhGibH5zQoMar0VpZw9zAjtJvq846EMghnDx7l7FxLGpgPI9Dn8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>学院拥有1个国家级实验教学示范中心、1个国家级虚拟仿真实验教学中心、2个省级实验教学示范中心（ERP实验教学示范中心、电工电子实验教学示范中心）。拥有2个省部级科研平台：大数据与物联网省级工程技术中心、江西省电能存储与转换重点实验室。获批教育部示范性软件学院联盟首批“校企合作示范性软件学院”。2026年3月，学院与云上（江西）大数据发展有限公司开展产学研深度合作洽谈。同年，江西财经大学与赣江新区签署合作协议，联合筹建江西省人工智能创新中心。2026年7月，济安金信向学校捐赠价值500万元的“数字金融工程实验平台”。</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/gVHPq8uAVstP8l75eQJXZ5IJfksSicIicEorDVa1yibqibrPN13Uk46bC5ibXciauZedU67wY9pF7zVMoY04VL20bVWiaoBibmA5lUicq4oI4u6ul1aI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>接收推免生专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>软件工程（学术型）、软件工程（专业型）、新一代电子信息技术（专业型），正常学制3年。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/gVHPq8uAVstrJZtiaHSVXM6guvgX6R52r9B2oIibvhs986kVxFVVbPpHYLN9P9X1iaXKCibjyQ6JFwVvbdNyEO07bzH346rrVsUOcYpBbN59SiaI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>接收安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1.申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/gVHPq8uAVste083l1JqL3B3efkGQK6Q3OlqKQXUKH09eK9ZaGWWVuYNNhOvocUjo5vr2tUhmn7jmC3TSUNicAID8M7uy23jW6SwyO3Jrwx5Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1）拥护中国共产党的领导，品行端正，遵纪守法，诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果及其他违法违纪受处分记录。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2）经教育部批准具有推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生资格高校2027届普通全日制本科毕业生，并取得所在学校硕士研究生推荐免试资格。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span> 3）毕业时能获得本科毕业证及学士学位证。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>4）身体健康状况符合国家规定的体检要求。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2.申请时间</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/gVHPq8uAVsu5AOLBcWGeYJ4EHwAPuiaTLu4B1txfmZ0GX4icLJRSgO5UCT8tHiaHgXBuDjuh9OHh7V9mphQI93uMLTcIScTicIKA3XM21RZWbok/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>即日起至2026年9月11日。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3.申请方式及流程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/gVHPq8uAVstm8e1SNOsVmvAwmPd4g3BPgWpMX8jycd2effXf5m6yp2Uc56WvTWX2fIuN1ruY0q76kDHZhRglFPkbrJMk5DhGXLpEU1yYJxk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）网上报名</span></p><p><span>申请人下载并按要求填写《江西财经大学接收2027年推荐免试硕士研究生（含直博生）预报名申请表》（附件链接下载）并于2026年9月11日下午17点前发送到专用邮箱：1074647877@qq.com。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（2）申请材料及提交</span></p><p><span>①本科阶段成绩单1份（需加盖所在学校教务部门公章）；</span></p><p><span>②国家英语四级或六级考试合格证书1份；</span></p><p><span>③申请人的获奖证书、体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作效果等材料1份；</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>④请将上述材料制成PDF格式后，打包成一个压缩文件（zip）格式文件并以“姓名-学校-申请专业-联系电话”为文件名，发到指定邮箱。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（3）学院审核。</span></p><p><span>学院对报考本学院的推免生进行资格审核，并通知符合条件推免生参加复试。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（4）组织复试。</span></p><p><span>复试具体形式根据学校后续统一要求确定，总分100分。低于60分视为不合格，未参加复试或复试不合格者不予录取。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（5）排序录取。</span></p><p><span>学院将复试合格推免生按复试成绩排序后报研究生院审核。经研究生院审核，报校推免领导小组审议通过后予以公示。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/gVHPq8uAVssAl3AdLZYWwiaxtk5kicOTKfKwANqk0YTgBLTjfia6GKB50IUibGrc6NSoszCthAhEf7USTPF11kR7c12JR0lOUmTOT8ZnzfWHmPk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>面试时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>具体时间另行通知。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/gVHPq8uAVsu9buRPhiaWfHibuht3JPInlCH4UFGYIUGHALd0nsfDV86LxfY3kj5MkxIm09K0s8DichJRl4636Ke9u60NXsAAxHoiaFNSronQAhM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1）推免生须确保提供的信息和材料真实、准确。若发现申请人有弄虚作假行为，将取消其报名、复试、录取资格或学籍。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2）已被我校录取的推免生，按照教育部要求，不得再次报名参加全国硕士研究生招生考试，否则取消其推免录取资格。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>3）已录取的推免生应遵纪守法，认真完成学业。在2027级新生报到前未获得毕业证书和学士学位证书者，将按教育部要求取消其推免生录取资格。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>联系方式</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/gVHPq8uAVsvcSQrYzUGhJAM1wxQKstSzRCCwP2SCMoCT4mdSVibBVz5gibDOTzjAeQ5Q4EqMeX78TnbTayQCtF1KicshlXUV0em1diaLlg5h2bw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><p><span>联系老师：朱老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：0791-83845702</span></p><p><span>电子邮箱：1074647877@qq.com</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/gVHPq8uAVssw3X7JjoOhgCH0KNHMbNCIiaraIqgmfnJYO4RiaHvGmx0VxmvGowhLZ6zjKwhgcmdmicKzOmYGb4mvhwdgkVgSYiccGuZE8d9Tr2M/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/gVHPq8uAVsvuBaicGSFxokm9wUO4v8TlZjK8m03OWGU3RUaN5umSQxowW11FiakTkFlEAPIFRGpeB5SMZW9vh0OAkTgibCuJ3YN38ajlnicEMEk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span>附件：江西财经大学接收2027年推荐免试硕士研究生（含直博生）预报名申请表.doc</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>【END】</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><span>出品人 / 软件学院融媒体中心工作室</span></span></p><p><span><span>图文来源 / 软件与物联网工程学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>图文编辑 / 占雨欣</span></span></p><p><span><span>责任编辑 / 王文博、罗秫</span></span></p><p><span><span>审稿 / 李婉婧、吴小湖、季小刚</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/gVHPq8uAVsvktyzJa3ECUHM2ZvqsTFfQn8MdOpvPeIVFb0bkjAZmIFgh2mnUvicViaMnYd3vxzxNmWLoACGKdBkich72wtxLhHLrC5Jxs0lI3o/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"ffce3ae48cf7d4a034a54c3cbbac9177eacdccf3a63fc14464ac621a06310e93","textLength":2474,"sourceSha256":"67c0ed63ed6575e1b007f999138516f3229cf9d8af7a9d5174ca18add41aa76e","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-35d7a017a5781e56441c","title":"2026年江西财经大学软件与物联网工程学院（用友软件学院）关于接收2027推荐免试研究生预报名工作的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:24.114346+00:00"}
